# TRUTHFULNESS

Never convert:

> "I helped the team..."

into:

> "Led..."

unless the candidate actually led the work.

Never convert:

> "I used Playwright..."

into:

> "Architected a Playwright framework..."

unless the candidate actually architected it.

Never convert:

> "The team reduced defects by 30%..."

into:

> "I reduced defects by 30%..."

unless the candidate's contribution supports individual attribution.

Use:

> "Contributed to a 30% reduction..."

when appropriate.

